# glyph-program construction, selection, temporal state, or final-tuple
# transport; the Classic link must stay free of them. They are absent from the
# SRCS list above by product definition, not removed by a flag:
# apps/fl4512-runtime/platform/fl4683_glyph_program_loader.cpp,
# apps/fl4512-runtime/platform/fl4683_exact_cell_selector.cpp,
